Intelligence Reports create something humans rarely have at high quality:
a continuously improving record of their own intelligence over time.
Imagine being able to look back years later and not merely see a calendar of events, but understand:
what you knew, what you learned, what changed your mind, what you built, what you solved, what failed, what worked, and why.
