The Intelligent Feed is primarily an experience and discovery layer, but it participates in the larger learning loop.
The relationship is:
EXPERIENCE → ACTIVITY → SMART NOTE → FEED → SAVE/LIST/SHARE/APPLY → OUTCOME → NEW INTELLIGENCE
